WEBVTT

00:00:00.192 --> 00:00:03.024
Your account is on the button with your name

00:00:03.074 --> 00:00:06.129
In <b>Mi perfil</b> (my profile) you see and edit your details

00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:10.468
<b>Tema</b> (theme) switches between light and dark, whatever is easier on your eyes

00:00:10.548 --> 00:00:14.259
And MiCaja speaks <b>English</b> too: change it here

00:00:14.405 --> 00:00:18.595
Everyone sets it up their own way on their own register
